# W5-DOCS: the strategy layer, added file by file after reading each one.
# Deliberately NOT a pattern like !docs/PLAY-*.md: a wildcard would auto-track any FUTURE
# doc, including one written with a key or a private address in it. Deny-by-default is the
# point, so a new doc stays ignored until a human has opened it and added its line here.
# All 101 below were scanned for keys, tokens, connection strings, card-like digits and
# email addresses, and read for what they are, on 2026-08-17.
